    "long_instructions": "## Thinking like a programmer\r\n\r\n#### Designing a pipeline is less about writing code first and more about asking the right questions:\r\n\r\n- #### What problem am I trying to solve for the user?\r\n- #### Which step needs to happen **first**?\r\n- #### What data should move on to the next step?\r\n- #### What should the final output look like?\r\n\r\n#### Two apps can use the **same data** but different pipelines — and get very different results.\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Activity Preview\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14pt; margin-top:16px;\">\r\nWatch the video below to see the steps in creating a pipeline for a \"for you\" feed for a fictional social media app. Use this video to guide you through the activity on the next level. \r\n<br><br>\r\nRemeber, when using AI, results can vary.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n"
  },
